msgid ""
"Native vLLM starts and chats successfully, but the same model launched through "
"Xinference fails with a recurrent-state dtype error."
msgstr "原生 vLLM 可以成功启动并对话，但通过 Xinference 启动同一模型时，出现循环状态的 dtype 错误。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
