#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_910b_operators.rst:59
msgid ""
"Launch through Xinference again, inspect the inherited operator environment and "
"confirm that the dtype error is gone and chat output is coherent. Record CANN, torch-"
"npu, vLLM and vLLM-Ascend versions alongside the image tag."
msgstr ""
"再次通过 Xinference 启动模型，检查进程继承的算子环境，确认 dtype 错误消失且对话输出连贯。同时记录镜像标签及 CANN、torch-npu、vLLM"
"、vLLM-Ascend 版本。"

